"""The thirty Holy archetypes of the Decennial roster (see evil.py for the shape of an archetype).

The Holy half of the dungeon is the road of light: angels, paladins, saints, sun and moon priests, dragons of order, celestial beasts, ancient guardians, holy knights, archons and the heralds of the
deities. Their halls are the cathedral, the celestial court, the sun temple, the hanging gardens, the sky bridge, the crystal sanctum, the moonlit glade and the storm spire, and the eight halls both
roads share. The abyssal looks are mostly dark, so the Holy bosses wear the Solar and the platinum dragon's looks, and the rest re-tinted and re-sized (a tint and a scale are data of the profile).
"""

